              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 20:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gökëra gayö, nömanyërë guiki gonsui garë Yoabhu, ömoona o Seruya aakoreeyë, abhakönaare bhabhërë bhi irichesi re Isiraeri, Abhuneri ömoona o Neri, na Amasa ömoona wa Yeteri. Naabhaitërë gönkaaga yö ömörembe gököhakana igisiomba kiu ubhuiti bhöno bhaakorrë gönkaaga yi iriihi. Naitërë abhantö bhano bhataana isaria, nani nkabharroa irisaria rëno rendëtera inyanko gikugira ya amakora gaae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo, uwe ökore gököreng'aana na öbhöng'aini bhooo, sibhoono ötagaacha kumutiga ayi Bhui kömörembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
